[resource]
script = ExtResource("1_ls7sk")
dialogue_id = "mq_3_10_begin"
record_title = "Era 三: Nature's Advice"
text = "PAGE: historian(STUDIO_SECONDARY), scribe(STUDIO_PRIMARY)
historian: I hear you've called a general assembly tomorrow.
historian: Have you found something new?
scribe: Indeed.
scribe: I have had a revelation.
scribe: We know that the Enlightened One has not abandoned us, so the fault must lie in our actions.
scribe: The hauntings are not what they seem.
historian: That would explain why no one can ever agree on the details...
scribe: That is because we were so quick to pacify them.
scribe: We should have observed instead.
scribe: You have seen as well as I that the spirits never take everything from us.
scribe: They merely limit our greed.
scribe: Enforce a balance.
historian: They would probably take all they can if we let them.
scribe: Only if we deserved it.
scribe: This justice...
scribe: It can only come from one source.
scribe: When the Old World shattered, the Enlightened One's divine spirit must have fractured.
scribe: Perhaps the hauntings are corrupted spirit shards...
scribe: The divine sorrow manifesting.
historian: Well, that's a grim thought.
historian: Not only are we alone, but our savior is corrupted and trying to fight us?
historian: I'm not sure I'm quite ready to give up hope just yet.
scribe: You misunderstand...
scribe: The hauntings are not the only fragments.
scribe: The Enlightened One is all around us.
scribe: In rushing rivers and ancient trees.
scribe: In shifting gales and wild beasts.
historian: Let's say you're right.
historian: What do you propose we do about it?
scribe: Have you noticed how birds always sing exactly at dawn?
scribe: Or how cicadas always emerge in thirteen year cycles?
scribe: These regularities are how the Enlightened One is communicating with us.
scribe: If we just listen, we will hear the divine will through the voice of nature."
metadata/_custom_type_script = "uid://jtkfcsyiryo4"
